$ ls -l     //check permissions
drwxr-xr-x 1 student students 122 Jan 13 12:00 mydirectory    
d or -: directory or standard file
rwx: owner permissions
r-x: group permissions
r-x: permissions of other people who are not in that group
1: the number of hard links to that directory or file
student: user owner
students: group owner
122: (bytes) size of the directory's filesystem metadata/entries, not the total size of its contents
Jan 13 12:00: modification time
mydirectory: name

